body:
I can't see anything in the embl entries either & I'm pretty sire we don't do the gene function assignment by text matching any longer (!). I was wondering if there was a pattern to when these kws appeared....looking at two they seem very different:

for wal:
oxidoreductase annotation appeared as an IBA in v.101 (2016)
https://rest.uniprot.org/unisave/Q7KN94?format=txt&versions=101

then v.125 (2018) we get the 
KW   Oxidoreductase {ECO:0000313|EMBL:AAF58627.1};
however the DR AAF58627 appeared much earlier in the entry

for Q9VN86:
This had an IEA from interpro that appeared in v.69 (2015)
the kw appears in v.98, and the interpro disappears in 99 (2015)
again the embl sequence reference appeared much earlier than the kw

@EBIDaveC any ideas?
